===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|:bor|de:Demokratie|tree=1}}
Ultimately from {{der|ru|la|democratia}} and {{der|ru|grc|δημοκρατία}}. First attested in 1704 as ''димократия'', mimicking the Greek pronunciation. 

